Voice data / consent
--------------------
The VCL is a timbre-shaping layer and does not itself clone a voice. Any
identity model built on top of it (so-vits-svc, RVC, or similar) must be
trained only on consented, licensed reference audio. Training on an
individual's voice without permission is outside the intended use of this
project and is the sole responsibility of the user.
